      "source": "But because each node contains a larger number of elements, the performance of the [`elements(inBoundingRectMin:rectMax:)`](gkrtree/elements(inboundingrectmin:rectmax:).md) method is slower (on average).",
      "normalizedSource": "But because each node contains a larger number of elements, the performance of the [`elements(inBoundingRectMin:rectMax:)`](gkrtree/elements(inboundingrectmin:rectmax:).md) method is slower (on average).",
