      "contextBefore": "Therefore, the performance of the [`addElement(_:boundingRectMin:boundingRectMax:splitStrategy:)`](gkrtree/addelement(_:boundingrectmin:boundingrectmax:splitstrategy:).md) method is faster (on average, across many calls).",
      "contextAfter": "A smaller `maxNumberOfChildren` value reverses the situation, improving performance for search operations at the cost of performance for add operations.",
